linear-796646965d-tj4fd.jpeg"},{"s":1795868110,"e":1795871216,"t":"Episodio 164","d":"Santos le pide a Bárbara que se vaya y Marisela la defiende. Bárbara amenaza a Gonzalo por traicionarla.","i":"https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2704468152_0_20260324T235000822Z_108_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-796646965d-bw4fq.jpeg"},{"s":1795871216,"e":1795874322,"t":"Episodio 165","d":"Bárbara convence a Gonzalo de sacar a Marisela. Santos y Marisela viven un apasionado momento juntos.","i":"https://tvpnlogopus.samsungcloud.tv/platform/image/contents/vc/00/LINEAR/US_USQT620324A_2704427814_2_20260324T235009614Z_18_imageprocessorclient-tvplus-linear-796646965d-tj4fd.jpeg"}]